  "title": "Vertiv expands thermal portfolio with new wall-mount cooling system for edge and small spaces in North America",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today announced the launch of the Vertiv™ CoolPhase Wall, a space-saving, wall-mount cooling system designed for small IT spaces and edge environments. The system is designed for the needs of IT equipment, removing heat and providing continuous operation while taking up zero floor space. Vertiv CoolPhase Wall is available now in North America.",
